<title>SWITZERLAND: Big Star shares sold by Bargella Invest.</title>
<headline>Big Star shares sold by Bargella Invest.</headline>
<dateline>ALLSCHWIL, Switzerland 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bargella Invest AG said it had sold 40,000 of its 80,000 shares in Big Star Holding AG, reducing its stake to 27 percent from a majority.</p>
<p>Bargella said in a statement 110,000 of Big Star's 150,000 shares are now widely held, but for Bargella's sole owner -- Laurin Faeh who is also founder of Big Star -- the participation in Big Star is a long-term nature.</p>
<p>The secondary placement of Big Star shares to Swiss and foreign investors was done by Bank J. Vontobel &amp; Co. AG.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
